              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Our work on McDonald's “Beyond the Arches” brought home both Silver and Bronze Pencils from The One Show. By highlighting authentic stories of franchise employees across the country, the campaign captured the real human experience behind one of the world's most recognizable brands.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
