              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "We don't manufacture drama for awards juries. As an independent agency, we look for the true story inside a business challenge and build work that resonates in the real market. When an international panel of creative leaders honors that work, it confirms that grounded storytelling performs.",
